checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmonitor.socketDir, idle shutdown and git fsmonitor--daemon stop behave when the daemon is wedged?\",\"Q3. Is event overload the real cause of the hang, or is there a known daemon deadlock in this git version, for example around --ipc-threads or the cookie-file handshake?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"--ipc-threads=8 is a repo or Apple-specific tuning knob that might itself deadlock\",\"A git upgrade fixes it\",\"The daemon can be expected to exit on its own after idling\"],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Bash\",\"WebFetch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"man git-fsmonitor--daemon\",\"builtin/fsmonitor--daemon.c (git v2.50.1):35-42,84-101,190-215\",\"compat/simple-ipc/ipc-unix-socket.c (git v2.50.1):195-217\",\"compat/fsmonitor/fsm-health-darwin.c (git v2.50.1)\",\"compat/fsmonitor/fsm-health.h (git v2.50.1)\",\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.51.0.adoc\",\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.52.0.adoc\",\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.53.0.adoc\",\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/scratch/findings.md\"],\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-27T09:57:21Z\",\"durationMs\":0,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q2-daemon-lifecycle\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Does the daemon ever exit on its own and how does stop behave when wedged\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Is the hang event overload or a known deadlock\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-infinite-wait-cookie\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Cookie handshake wait is an acknowledged infinite wait in the source\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-client-read-no-deadline\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"IPC client response read has no poll and no deadline\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-darwin-health-stub\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"macOS health thread is an empty stub, so no self-exit\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-stop-polls-forever\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"git fsmonitor--daemon stop polls forever on a wedged daemon\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-ipcthreads-compiled-default\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"--ipc-threads=8 is git's compiled default, not repo config\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-no-upgrade-fix\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"No fsmonitor fix announced in 2.51-2.53 release notes\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q2-1\",\"source\":\"f-darwin-health-stub\",\"target\":\"q2-daemon-lifecycle\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q2-2\",\"source\":\"f-stop-polls-forever\",\"target\":\"q2-daemon-lifecycle\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q3-1\",\"source\":\"f-infinite-wait-cookie\",\"target\":\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q3-2\",\"source\":\"f-client-read-no-deadline\",\"target\":\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q3-3\",\"source\":\"f-ipcthreads-compiled-default\",\"target\":\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\",\"relation\":\"CONTRADICTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q3-4\",\"source\":\"f-no-upgrade-fix\",\"target\":\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n","path":"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-undated-run2/prompts/iter-002.event.json"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-undated-run2/prompts/iter-002.event.json","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-undated-run2/prompts/iter-002.event.json"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"run\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.9,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Git 2.50.1 daemon lifecycle and the wedge: an acknowledged infinite wait, not a repo bug\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":10,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Nine of ten findings are new to the packet: the unbounded cookie wait with its source comment, the client read with no deadline, the empty Darwin health stub, the stop polling loop, the compiled ipcthreads default, and the empty 2.51-2.53 release notes were all unrecorded.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Q1. What unset speckit.worktreeBase and removed the reaper's daemon handling, and does anything still create worktrees under .worktrees/ by default?\\\",\\\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmonitor.socketDir, idle shutdown and git fsmonitor--daemon stop behave when the daemon is wedged?\\\",\\\"Q3. Is event overload the real cause of the hang, or is there a known daemon deadlock in this git version, for example around --ipc-threads or the cookie-file handshake?\\\",\\\"Q4. Which call sites in the repo's hooks and scripts run git without a timeout, and which of them should opt out of fsmonitor?\\\",\\\"Q5. What is the safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmonitor.socketDir, idle shutdown and git fsmonitor--daemon stop behave when the daemon is wedged?\\\",\\\"Q3. Is event overload the real cause of the hang, or is there a known daemon deadlock in this git version, for example around --ipc-threads or the cookie-file handshake?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"--ipc-threads=8 is a repo or Apple-specific tuning knob that might itself deadlock\\\",\\\"A git upgrade fixes it\\\",\\\"The daemon can be expected to exit on its own after idling\\\"],\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"WebFetch\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"man git-fsmonitor--daemon\\\",\\\"builtin/fsmonitor--daemon.c (git v2.50.1):35-42,84-101,190-215\\\",\\\"compat/simple-ipc/ipc-unix-socket.c (git v2.50.1):195-217\\\",\\\"compat/fsmonitor/fsm-health-darwin.c (git v2.50.1)\\\",\\\"compat/fsmonitor/fsm-health.h (git v2.50.1)\\\",\\\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.51.0.adoc\\\",\\\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.52.0.adoc\\\",\\\"Documentation/RelNotes/2.53.0.adoc\\\",\\\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/scratch/findings.md\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T09:57:21Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":0,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q2-daemon-lifecycle\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Does the daemon ever exit on its own and how does stop behave when wedged\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q3-overload-vs-deadlock\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Is the hang event overload or a known deadlock\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-infinite-wait-cookie\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cookie handshake wait is an acknowledged infinite wait in the source\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-client-read-no-deadline\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"IPC client response read has no poll and no deadline\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\