{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793095271509,"sessionID":"ses_e833fbb1effewOnhN31WYdpXxT","part":{"partID":"prt_17cce5b8e002drGeiRStQDQ2SU","sessionID":"ses_e833fbb1effewOnhN31WYdpXxT","messageID":"msg_17cce409d001YJKSsBsiK738ly","type":"tool","id":"call_7dd206a80e2d80606ca47122","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-undated-run2-1793094321851-ufzori\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"The repo's unbounded git call sites and the safest default posture\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Nine of ten findings are new to the packet: the hook chain to the hung spawnSync, the existing GIT_NO_FSMONITOR convention, the sibling unbounded call sites, the timeout precedents, the socket attribution, and the derived default posture were all unrecorded.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Q1. What unset speckit.worktreeBase and removed the reaper's daemon handling, and does anything still create worktrees under .worktrees/ by default?\",\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmonitor.socketDir, idle shutdown and git fsmonitor--daemon stop behave when the daemon is wedged?\",\"Q3. Is event overload the real cause of the hang, or is there a known daemon deadlock in this git version, for example around --ipc-threads or the cookie-file handshake?\",\"Q4. Which call sites in the repo's hooks and scripts run git without a timeout, and which of them should opt out of fsmonitor?\",\"Q5. What is the safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Q4. Which call sites in the repo's hooks and scripts run git without a timeout, and which of them should opt out of fsmonitor?\",\"Q5. What is the safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Disable fsmonitor everywhere\",\"Match daemons by command line\",\"Rely on git fsmonitor--daemon stop in a reaper\",\"Restore the reaper's daemon handling\"],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs:51\",\"~/.config/git/hooks/pre-push:417\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/scripts/verify-router-sync.cjs:168\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/regenerate-skill-derived.cjs:73\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-source-tags-helper.mjs:206\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-scan.mjs:145\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/continuity-freshness.ts:38\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/lib/run-check.cjs:28\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/hook-flags.sh:20\",\".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/lib/message-contract.mjs:262\",\".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs:290\",\"rg git spawn sites under .skilled\",\"lsof socket attribution PIDs 1157,5979\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-27T09:59:59Z\",\"durationMs\":0,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which git call sites lack a timeout and which should opt out of fsmonitor\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q5-safest-default\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Safest default posture for fsmonitor and worktrees\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-hung-site-no-ceiling\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129 has no timeout and no fsmonitor opt-out\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-hook-chain\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Pre-push gate chain reaches the hung spawnSync via ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-git-no-fsmonitor-convention\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Repo already uses -c core.fsmonitor=false in six or more call sites\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-sibling-unbounded-sites\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"verify-router-sync and regenerate-skill-derived check-ignore calls are unbounded\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-timeout-precedents\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"GIT_TIMEOUT_MS and timeout:3000 are existing repo patterns\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-socket-attribution\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Main daemon identifiable by .git/fsmonitor--daemon.ipc socket path\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-default-posture\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-1\",\"source\":\"f-hung-site-no-ceiling\",\"target\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-2\",\"source\":\"f-hook-chain\",\"target\":\"f-hung-site-no-ceiling\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-3\",\"source\":\"f-git-no-fsmonitor-convention\",\"target\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-4\",\"source\":\"f-sibling-unbounded-sites\",\"target\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-5\",\"source\":\"f-timeout-precedents\",\"target\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q5-1\",\"source\":\"f-default-posture\",\"target\":\"q5-safest-default\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q5-2\",\"source\":\"f-socket-attribution\",\"target\":\"q5-safest-default\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n","path":"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocati