figured iterations)\n- Total iterations: 3\n- Questions answered: 5 / 5\n- Remaining questions: 0 of the packet's five; four implementation-level open questions are recorded in section 12\n- Last 3 iteration summaries:\n  - run 1: sk-git/026 regression — the reaper's daemon block and the re-based worktree default (0.85)\n  - run 2: git 2.50.1 fsmonitor daemon lifecycle and the unbounded cookie wait (0.90)\n  - run 3: unbounded git call sites and the safest default posture (0.80)\n- Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry only under `max-iterations`)\n- Divergence summary: no divergent pivots recorded; no saturated direction; frontier is measurement and implementation\n- Segment transitions, wave scores and checkpoint metrics are experimental and omitted from the live report.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"L=\\\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-undated-run2\\\"; ls \\\"$L/steer.md\\\" 2>&1; echo \\\"=== sibling research.md section headings ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"^## \\\\|^# \\\" \\\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-1017/research.md\\\"; echo \\\"=== sibling research.md tail (convergence report) ===\\\"; tail -40 \\\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-1017/research.md\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1793095300782,"end":1793095302276}}}}
